    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、大丈夫だよ\r\nその量は一晩じゃ読みきれないだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンレター、じっくり読んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます\r\nでも、真乃とめぐるにも早く読んでもらいたいですし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040190"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0117",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1900
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 600
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00414",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgm": "0121",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "最近は、以前のように３人で読むこともできないので……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\n忙しいもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\nとてもありがたいことです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgm": "0000",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "autoWaitTime": 1800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "でも、もしかしたら、\r\n言わなくてよかったのかも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00543",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "もう来られないって聞いて、\r\nイルミネのみんながうれしいはずないもんね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "なんにも言わずに、なんにも変わらずに、\r\n笑顔でハイタッチ──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "それでよかったんだよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "………………うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "うん！　あれでよかったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "123"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "そうだよ\r\n変なこと言わなくてよかったあ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "あー、よかった……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "autoWaitTime": 1800
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00414",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0117",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1350
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 400
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "色々相談して、通話を増やしているんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "通話？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "仕事の話だとか、レッスンの話だとか、\r\nそれぞれの学校の話だとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "何時からと決めているわけじゃないんですけど\r\n３人で話す時間を作るようにしていて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "ファンレターの中だけは、\r\nいままでと変わらずにいよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "なんにも変わらず、\r\n友達と一緒に応援していますよって書こう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "いままでだって、私が感想を代筆していたんだもん\r\nこれからもそうすればいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "新曲もふたりで聞いたよって書く\r\nライブもふたりで行ったよって書く",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "うん、それがいい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "autoWaitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "少女",
    "text": "真乃ちゃん、灯織ちゃん、めぐるちゃんを、\r\n悲しませたくないもん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00310",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "昔は、距離が人を分けてしまうものだったんだ\r\n引っ越しとか、転勤とか──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも今は関係ないんだな\r\nいつでも繋がるツールがあるんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね、メッセもありますし……\r\nもちろん、直接会うに越したことはないんですが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060040260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、会えない隙間は埋めてくれます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106004/4001060040260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
